---
{
  title: "vowel"
}
---
### NAME

    vowel() - Tests whether a character code is an ASCII vowel, in either
    case.

### SYNOPSIS

    int vowel( int c );

### DESCRIPTION

    Tests whether a character code is an ASCII vowel, in either case.

### PARAMETERS

    c  (int)
       The character code to test.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if `c` is a/e/i/o/u (upper or lower case), 0 otherwise.

### EXAMPLE

    {{di1}}vowel('a');  // 1
    vowel('A');  // 1
    vowel('z');  // 0{{di0}}
